From: CB1 <cb1@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/nvkms: native player-led 422/12 from an integer RGB16 primary

Keep the packed RGB8 carriers intact. A separate enum requests native
YCbCr422, limited range, 12 bpc and BT.2020 CSC from ABGR16161616.
Reuse the per-head integer composition bypass and the existing passthrough
validation, retaining OCSC1 while disabling the FP16 LUT/composition path.
Do not require static HDR EDID signaling for this Dolby-signaled route,
and clear a previous static HDR packet on hardware with separate slots.

